<title>CHINA: China Jan copper exports soar 186.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan copper exports soar 186.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's exports of uncast and raw copper soared by 186.4 percent to 11,110 tonnes in January compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exports of uncast copper including alloys reached 5,863 tonnes in January, skyrocketed by 1,000.7 percent compared with the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>China's imports of uncast and raw copper rose 44 percent to 45,176 tonnes in January, the figures showed.</p>
<p>Imports of uncast copper including alloys were up 41.5 percent to 8,281 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
